<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal 6 </b>related to the ratification
of the appointment of Marcum LLP as our independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December&#160;31, 2023.
Proposal 6 was approved by a majority of votes cast at the Annual Meeting, based upon the following votes:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

